Alembic migrations for VoiceGuard V2.

Commands (run from ``backend/``):

  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"
  alembic upgrade head
  alembic downgrade -1

The environment (``env.py``) automatically rewrites the async
``postgresql+asyncpg://`` URL from settings to a synchronous
``postgresql+psycopg2://`` URL, so no password is committed here.
